rvatively count only dogs that are clearly visible and performing, the number is **far greater than 0**.\n\n✅ **Therefore, the correct answer is NOT '0'. The claim that zero dogs go on stage in the first hour is false based on the provided frames.**"}, {'batch_start': 150, 'batch_end': 180, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/vZV2WCKMsKs/frames/frame_1400.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/vZV2WCKMsKs/frames/frame_1401.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/vZV2WCKMsKs/frames/frame_1402.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/vZV2WCKMsKs/frames/frame_1403.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/vZV2WCKMsKs/frames/frame_1404.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/vZV2WCKMsKs/frames/frame_1405.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/vZV2WCKMsKs/frames/frame_1406.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/vZV2WCKMsKs/frames/frame_1407.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/vZV2WCKMsKs/frames/frame_1408.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/vZV2WCKMsKs/frames/frame_1409.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/vZV2WCKMsKs/frames/frame_1410.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/vZV2WCKMsKs/frames/frame_1411.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/vZV2WCKMsKs/frames/frame_1412.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/vZV2WCKMsKs/frames/frame_1413.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/vZV2WCKMsKs/frames/frame_1414.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/vZV2WCKMsKs/frames/frame_1415.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/vZV2WCKMsKs/frames/frame_1416.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/vZV2WCKMsKs/frames/frame_1417.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/vZV2WCKMsKs/frames/frame_1418.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/vZV2WCKMsKs/frames/frame_1419.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/vZV2WCKMsKs/frames/frame_1421.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/vZV2WCKMsKs/frames/frame_1422.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvben